1
00:00:04,980 --> 00:00:06,270
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Are you saying...</b></font>

2
00:00:10,070 --> 00:00:11,610
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>that I...</b></font>

3
00:00:12,440 --> 00:00:15,110
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>have regrets?</b></font>

4
00:00:17,270 --> 00:00:22,820
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You told me, "I'm no one...
I don't want to be anyone..."</b></font>

5
00:00:23,820 --> 00:00:25,980
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>But the truth is...</b></font>

6
00:00:26,070 --> 00:00:28,520
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You wanted to become
the Hokage, just like me.</b></font>

7
00:00:29,770 --> 00:00:32,190
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You can't hide behind a mask.</b></font>

8
00:00:33,440 --> 00:00:36,610
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You were Kakashi Sensei's friend...</b></font>

9
00:00:36,690 --> 00:00:40,730
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>my dad's subordinate...
an Uchiha like Sasuke...</b></font>

10
00:00:41,570 --> 00:00:44,020
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>and a shinobi of the Hidden Leaf</b></font>

11
00:00:44,110 --> 00:00:46,690
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>who had the same dream as me!</b></font>

12
00:00:47,690 --> 00:00:50,070
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You used to have
the same dream as me.</b></font>

13
00:00:50,650 --> 00:00:52,650
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>But now you've become
the exact opposite of a Hokage!</b></font>

14
00:00:53,520 --> 00:00:55,520
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>It's because you're just
like me that...</b></font>

15
00:00:55,610 --> 00:00:57,610
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>No, it's because of that...</b></font>

16
00:00:59,230 --> 00:01:03,110
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>That's why I wanted to see you
despairing about this world.</b></font>

17
00:01:04,270 --> 00:01:07,860
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Or...I suppose I wanted
to feel again for myself,</b></font>

18
00:01:08,940 --> 00:01:12,730
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>that the path that I have chosen
for myself is not a mistake.</b></font>

19
00:01:15,360 --> 00:01:19,230
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>There's no need to voluntarily tread
a steep and rugged path,</b></font>

20
00:01:19,320 --> 00:01:21,270
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>not knowing what's ahead.</b></font>

21
00:01:21,940 --> 00:01:24,320
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You'll have to step over
the corpses of your comrades.</b></font>

22
00:01:25,940 --> 00:01:30,770
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Anyone would choose a shortcut
with a fixed outcome.</b></font>

23
00:01:31,770 --> 00:01:37,230
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Yes... The goal a Hokage should
seek is world peace.</b></font>

24
00:01:38,860 --> 00:01:40,900
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>What are you saying?</b></font>

25
00:01:43,230 --> 00:01:47,150
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>What I want to know about
isn't a shortcut...</b></font>

26
00:01:48,110 --> 00:01:50,570
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>but how to navigate
the steep and rugged path!</b></font>

27
00:01:52,070 --> 00:01:56,900
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Who can tell in the beginning
which one is the dangerous one?</b></font>

28
00:01:57,360 --> 00:02:00,520
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You never know
unless you start walking.</b></font>

29
00:02:03,400 --> 00:02:06,440
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>The Hokage is someone
who endures the pain</b></font>

30
00:02:06,520 --> 00:02:08,940
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>and takes the lead
in front of everyone.</b></font>

31
00:02:09,610 --> 00:02:12,480
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>So a Hokage never walks over
his comrades' corpses.</b></font>

32
00:02:14,610 --> 00:02:17,520
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>There are no shortcuts for
the one who becomes the Hokage...</b></font>

33
00:02:17,610 --> 00:02:20,440
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>There's no running away
for the one who becomes the Hokage!</b></font>

34
00:02:21,650 --> 00:02:22,520
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Isn't that right?</b></font>

35
00:02:25,520 --> 00:02:27,270
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>I messed up...</i></b></font>

36
00:02:27,440 --> 00:02:28,900
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>I got some dust in my eyes and...</i></b></font>

37
00:02:28,980 --> 00:02:30,230
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>Oww!</i></b></font>

38
00:02:36,900 --> 00:02:40,570
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I bet this Rin person would
say this if she were still alive...</b></font>

39
00:02:42,570 --> 00:02:45,190
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>"Don't act tough and
hide your wounds."</b></font>

40
00:02:45,690 --> 00:02:47,610
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>"I'm always watching."</b></font>

41
00:02:49,570 --> 00:02:51,440
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>You told me saving you</i></b></font>

42
00:02:51,520 --> 00:02:53,860
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>was the same as</i>
<i>saving the world, remember?</i></b></font>

43
00:02:54,520 --> 00:02:57,570
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>Since I'm keeping an eye on you,</i></b></font>

44
00:02:57,650 --> 00:03:00,270
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>you can't hide anything</i>
<i>from me anymore.</i></b></font>

45
00:03:00,770 --> 00:03:02,940
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>Okay! Okay!</i></b></font>

46
00:03:04,230 --> 00:03:05,820
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>Go for it, Obito!</i></b></font>

47
00:03:06,650 --> 00:03:10,320
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>Become Hokage and show me</i>
<i>how you'll save the world.</i></b></font>

48
00:03:10,650 --> 00:03:12,610
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>That's another promise!</i></b></font>

49
00:03:23,820 --> 00:03:24,860
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Rin...</b></font>

50
00:03:26,070 --> 00:03:29,320
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Rin was my only light and hope.</b></font>

51
00:03:32,070 --> 00:03:34,110
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>After I lost Rin...</b></font>

52
00:03:34,480 --> 00:03:36,820
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>the world as I saw it, changed.</b></font>

53
00:03:38,070 --> 00:03:39,860
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>It became a pitch-black hell.</b></font>

54
00:03:45,940 --> 00:03:47,980
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>There's no hope in this world.</b></font>

55
00:03:48,900 --> 00:03:51,940
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I took Madara's identity
and walked the world.</b></font>

56
00:03:52,480 --> 00:03:55,440
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>But all it did was confirm my belief.</b></font>

57
00:03:57,230 --> 00:04:01,440
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Even with my Sharingan,
I couldn't see anything...</b></font>

58
00:04:02,650 --> 00:04:04,650
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>There was nothing to see.</b></font>

59
00:04:06,400 --> 00:04:09,360
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I'm sure you could've seen it too,
if you'd tried.</b></font>

60
00:04:10,400 --> 00:04:13,610
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>After all, you and I have
the same eyes.</b></font>

61
00:04:15,690 --> 00:04:18,440
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>If comrades that you trust,
gather around you...</b></font>

62
00:04:18,520 --> 00:04:21,650
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>hope can take physical form
and become visible.</b></font>

63
00:04:23,110 --> 00:04:25,650
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>That's what I believe...</b></font>

64
00:04:28,440 --> 00:04:29,820
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Obito.</b></font>

65
00:04:40,860 --> 00:04:42,610
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Naruto's path, huh...</b></font>

66
00:06:16,390 --> 00:06:17,980
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>Madara Uchiha Arises</i>

</b></font>

67
00:06:17,980 --> 00:06:20,270
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Sage Art: Gracious Deity Gates!

<i>Madara Uchiha Arises</i>

</b></font>

68
00:06:25,810 --> 00:06:28,390
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>Naruto's jutsu didn't bring him down,</i></b></font>

69
00:06:28,600 --> 00:06:32,310
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>but with this,</i>
<i>he won't be able to move at all!</i></b></font>

70
00:06:33,350 --> 00:06:36,810
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>All that's left is to wait for</i>
<i>the Sealing Shinobi.</i></b></font>

71
00:06:55,390 --> 00:06:58,100
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Having the Tailed Beasts
extracted from him</b></font>

72
00:06:58,180 --> 00:06:59,770
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>means that Obito's...</b></font>

73
00:07:00,930 --> 00:07:04,980
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>The Ten Tails' Jinchuriki aren't
like all the others.</b></font>

74
00:07:06,350 --> 00:07:08,810
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>They won't die if
the Tailed Beast is extracted.</b></font>

75
00:07:09,730 --> 00:07:15,390
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>It's because the Ten Tails' husk,
the Gedo Statue remains.</b></font>

76
00:07:16,890 --> 00:07:19,430
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>It contains a lot of life force.</b></font>

77
00:07:20,060 --> 00:07:21,270
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Is that true?</b></font>

78
00:07:21,350 --> 00:07:23,350
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>How do you know?</b></font>

79
00:07:23,520 --> 00:07:24,890
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Hey, now.</b></font>

80
00:07:24,980 --> 00:07:27,810
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Who do you think scattered us
all across the world</b></font>

81
00:07:27,890 --> 00:07:31,520
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>after splitting Ten Tails' Chakra
into nine pieces?</b></font>

82
00:07:33,640 --> 00:07:35,350
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>The Sage of Six Paths...</b></font>

83
00:07:35,810 --> 00:07:39,480
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>But with nine bodies extracted out
of him all at once,</b></font>

84
00:07:39,560 --> 00:07:41,850
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>he'll be so weak it will
be like he's dead.</b></font>

85
00:07:42,060 --> 00:07:44,770
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>He won't be able to move
for a few months.</b></font>

86
00:07:45,600 --> 00:07:48,230
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Just as it was for
the old man back then.</b></font>

87
00:07:49,560 --> 00:07:51,270
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>So that's how it goes.</b></font>

88
00:07:52,480 --> 00:07:53,890
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Kakashi...</b></font>

89
00:07:55,180 --> 00:07:57,980
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>the Tailed Beast inside me
just explained to me...</b></font>

90
00:08:02,930 --> 00:08:04,180
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>That's right...</i></b></font>

91
00:08:04,270 --> 00:08:07,180
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>Rin won't even turn</i>
<i>to look at the current you.</i></b></font>

92
00:08:09,390 --> 00:08:13,850
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>The one Rin wanted to watch over</i>
<i>is Obito Uchiha.</i></b></font>

93
00:08:16,180 --> 00:08:18,890
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>So you don't have to worry.</b></font>

94
00:08:21,520 --> 00:08:24,140
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Then...his life is...</b></font>

95
00:08:29,180 --> 00:08:34,100
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I was hoping he would atone
for all his past deeds, but...</b></font>

96
00:08:36,390 --> 00:08:38,730
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>It can't be helped if you can't move.</b></font>

97
00:08:39,350 --> 00:08:41,520
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Just stay put.</b></font>

98
00:08:43,480 --> 00:08:46,730
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Sensei, please keep an eye
on Obito.</b></font>

99
00:08:47,430 --> 00:08:48,480
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>All right.</b></font>

100
00:08:55,430 --> 00:08:57,100
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>What are you trying to do?</b></font>

101
00:09:02,310 --> 00:09:05,930
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>The same thing the man
I once tried to use...</b></font>

102
00:09:07,560 --> 00:09:10,930
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>did to betray me.</b></font>

103
00:09:17,600 --> 00:09:18,890
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>No way...</b></font>

104
00:09:19,480 --> 00:09:26,140
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I never imagined I'd end up
doing the same thing...</b></font>

105
00:09:28,350 --> 00:09:30,390
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>It's the Gedo...</b></font>

106
00:09:30,600 --> 00:09:33,390
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Art of Rinne Rebirth.</b></font>

107
00:09:35,680 --> 00:09:39,600
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>But that jutsu will result in your...!</b></font>

108
00:09:57,930 --> 00:10:00,850
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>It seems to be a jutsu</i>
<i>that trades life for life.</i></b></font>

109
00:10:03,140 --> 00:10:08,680
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I feel like I finally understand
why Nagato…</b></font>

110
00:10:09,020 --> 00:10:11,480
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>betrayed me back then.</b></font>

111
00:10:14,350 --> 00:10:20,980
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>A string of hearts linked together
like prayer beads...</b></font>

112
00:10:21,810 --> 00:10:25,180
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>That can be a strong power
as well, huh...</b></font>

113
00:10:26,350 --> 00:10:30,520
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Nagato and Naruto were
both Jiraiya's students.</b></font>

114
00:10:30,520 --> 00:10:36,480
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>So you could say
Jiraiya defeated me.</b></font>

115
00:10:37,350 --> 00:10:38,680
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Sensei...</b></font>

116
00:10:40,310 --> 00:10:42,390
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>He was also your master,</b></font>

117
00:10:42,480 --> 00:10:45,640
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>the one who groomed you
to become the Hokage...</b></font>

118
00:10:48,180 --> 00:10:53,560
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>And I...was your student.</b></font>

119
00:10:56,140 --> 00:10:59,390
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>A shinobi who gave up
on becoming Hokage...</b></font>

120
00:10:59,480 --> 00:11:02,480
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>and cut all his ties.</b></font>

121
00:11:09,730 --> 00:11:16,480
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I won't have much to say
to Rin on the other side.</b></font>

122
00:11:20,430 --> 00:11:22,180
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Are you sure about this?</b></font>

123
00:11:23,890 --> 00:11:26,350
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You could live and atone
for your sins...</b></font>

124
00:11:28,770 --> 00:11:34,430
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>No... That's the easy way out.</b></font>

125
00:11:41,020 --> 00:11:46,480
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I'll help you out this time!</b></font>

126
00:11:48,560 --> 00:11:50,020
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Time to switch places!</b></font>

127
00:11:51,430 --> 00:11:54,730
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>It's now my turn to attack!</b></font>

128
00:11:55,520 --> 00:11:56,770
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Stop acting tough!</b></font>

129
00:11:57,140 --> 00:11:59,270
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>This war is over!</b></font>

130
00:12:04,230 --> 00:12:05,810
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>– Sai!
– I know!</b></font>

131
00:12:07,350 --> 00:12:08,520
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Sealing Jutsu!</b></font>

132
00:12:09,480 --> 00:12:10,930
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Crouched Tiger Bullet!</b></font>

133
00:12:12,890 --> 00:12:14,140
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Naruto...</b></font>

134
00:12:15,390 --> 00:12:17,680
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I'm grateful to you.</b></font>

135
00:12:19,060 --> 00:12:22,560
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You even extracted
the Tailed Beasts from Obito...</b></font>

136
00:12:25,520 --> 00:12:29,350
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Saving me the trouble
of weakening him.</b></font>

137
00:12:29,680 --> 00:12:32,350
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Sorry, Obito...</b></font>

138
00:12:33,140 --> 00:12:37,270
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>This is the reason
why I was stuck onto you.</b></font>

139
00:12:37,640 --> 00:12:40,060
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Black Zetsu!
W-What the—?!</b></font>

140
00:12:41,810 --> 00:12:43,230
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Okay! Just a little bit longer!</b></font>

141
00:12:44,930 --> 00:12:47,350
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>– Art of Rinne Rebirth!
– Art of Rinne Rebirth!</b></font>

142
00:12:50,140 --> 00:12:52,730
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Finally, I can fight for real!</b></font>

143
00:13:23,810 --> 00:13:27,350
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>This is the form,
the body I needed!</b></font>

144
00:13:30,140 --> 00:13:36,770
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>It's not a battle without raging blood...
and a pounding heart!</b></font>

145
00:13:53,100 --> 00:13:55,180
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Ancient relics...</b></font>

146
00:13:56,020 --> 00:13:57,480
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>should just butt out!</b></font>

147
00:14:01,020 --> 00:14:05,310
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>A brat who doesn't even
come close to my level.</b></font>

148
00:14:07,100 --> 00:14:09,520
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You stole my line.</b></font>

149
00:14:11,770 --> 00:14:13,930
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>Why did he close his eyes?</i></b></font>

150
00:14:14,560 --> 00:14:15,600
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Sasuke!</b></font>

151
00:14:16,600 --> 00:14:19,560
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>It's pointless to just
throw attacks at him.</b></font>

152
00:14:20,480 --> 00:14:23,390
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>This guy can absorb ninjutsu!</b></font>

153
00:14:29,430 --> 00:14:32,270
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>It is these two polar opposites
operating together</b></font>

154
00:14:32,350 --> 00:14:34,730
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>that give rise to all things
in this universe...</b></font>

155
00:14:36,180 --> 00:14:40,270
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Hashirama, do you remember me
telling you this long ago</b></font>

156
00:14:40,350 --> 00:14:43,430
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>in front of the Uchiha Stone Tablet?</b></font>

157
00:14:45,390 --> 00:14:48,270
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>That the inscription
on the stone says,</b></font>

158
00:14:48,350 --> 00:14:53,770
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>when two opposite sides cooperate,
you have true happiness.</b></font>

159
00:14:54,730 --> 00:14:59,020
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>But I also told you it could
be interpreted differently.</b></font>

160
00:15:02,480 --> 00:15:03,480
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>That's...</b></font>

161
00:15:04,520 --> 00:15:08,810
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>The one who obtains
both Uchiha and Senju powers</b></font>

162
00:15:08,890 --> 00:15:12,560
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>can attain true happiness.</b></font>

163
00:15:13,270 --> 00:15:16,270
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Don't you think it could be read
that way as well?</b></font>

164
00:15:17,520 --> 00:15:19,390
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Hashirama?</b></font>

165
00:15:20,480 --> 00:15:23,020
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>It seems you've been doing
a lot of plotting</b></font>

166
00:15:23,100 --> 00:15:25,520
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>since you left the village.</b></font>

167
00:15:26,810 --> 00:15:28,390
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>No... Actually, this is something</b></font>

168
00:15:28,390 --> 00:15:32,100
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>my subordinate's comrade came up
with by coincidence.</b></font>

169
00:15:32,770 --> 00:15:37,060
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Seems there was a fellow
who thought a lot like me.</b></font>

170
00:15:40,560 --> 00:15:41,730
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>However...</b></font>

171
00:15:41,810 --> 00:15:46,810
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Me coming back to life
was exactly as planned!</b></font>

172
00:15:51,640 --> 00:15:53,600
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>Damn it... I can't move!</i></b></font>

173
00:16:06,480 --> 00:16:09,310
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Though things did happen
out of order.</b></font>

174
00:16:09,390 --> 00:16:10,480
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Oh well.</b></font>

175
00:16:16,020 --> 00:16:18,850
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>So this is Sage Art Chakra...</b></font>

176
00:16:20,850 --> 00:16:24,350
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Is that all there is to it?</b></font>

177
00:16:24,680 --> 00:16:27,230
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Seems like this will
be easy to control.</b></font>

178
00:16:40,520 --> 00:16:44,060
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>This is the perfect chance now
that you're flesh and blood.</b></font>

179
00:16:44,430 --> 00:16:46,810
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>This time I'll kill you for good,</b></font>

180
00:16:47,560 --> 00:16:49,980
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>and send you back
to the afterlife!</b></font>

181
00:16:52,060 --> 00:16:55,560
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Regret that you're still not
a reanimation…</b></font>

182
00:16:58,140 --> 00:17:00,230
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>as you go to your death!</b></font>

183
00:17:06,980 --> 00:17:08,560
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I can feel it...</b></font>

184
00:17:08,890 --> 00:17:12,730
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Your Mangekyo are Choku Tomoe,
a straight pattern.</b></font>

185
00:17:13,770 --> 00:17:16,560
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>No wonder you have fine moves.</b></font>

186
00:17:16,930 --> 00:17:20,390
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>It might be a good idea
to take your eyes</b></font>

187
00:17:20,480 --> 00:17:24,350
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>until I get my Rinnegan back.</b></font>

188
00:17:28,270 --> 00:17:33,100
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Obito... Your usefulness is over.</b></font>

189
00:17:37,230 --> 00:17:38,180
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>What did you do?</b></font>

190
00:17:40,100 --> 00:17:41,310
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Madara…</b></font>

191
00:17:43,520 --> 00:17:45,390
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>has come back to life!</b></font>

192
00:17:48,230 --> 00:17:52,560
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You performed the Rinne Rebirth,
so you will die.</b></font>

193
00:17:52,730 --> 00:17:55,480
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>This is the last step.</b></font>

194
00:17:55,890 --> 00:17:58,680
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I'm taking back that left eye.</b></font>

195
00:18:02,100 --> 00:18:09,520
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>He'll last a little while longer
while I'm attached to him.</b></font>

196
00:18:10,230 --> 00:18:11,520
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Just what are you?</b></font>

197
00:18:11,980 --> 00:18:13,350
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You're not human.</b></font>

198
00:18:14,020 --> 00:18:18,100
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I am Madara's will incarnate.</b></font>

199
00:18:18,350 --> 00:18:22,390
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I will eliminate anyone
who gets in Madara's way.</b></font>

200
00:18:22,810 --> 00:18:24,230
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Black Zetsu.</b></font>

201
00:18:24,980 --> 00:18:26,980
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I thought you'd been captured...</b></font>

202
00:18:27,640 --> 00:18:34,850
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>All of you, including Obito, greatly
underestimated Madara's plan.</b></font>

203
00:18:35,680 --> 00:18:39,730
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You underestimated me as well.</b></font>

204
00:18:42,890 --> 00:18:46,100
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>I-I can't move now...</i></b></font>

205
00:18:46,520 --> 00:18:49,140
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>I can't believe he's able</i>
<i>to transform his blade so much</i></b></font>

206
00:18:49,230 --> 00:18:51,020
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>in such an instant!</i></b></font>

207
00:18:52,310 --> 00:18:53,810
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>Then that's perfect.</i></b></font>

208
00:18:54,430 --> 00:18:56,350
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>You'll go to Obito and</i></b></font>

209
00:18:56,350 --> 00:18:58,770
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>bide your time until</i>
<i>I give you the order.</i></b></font>

210
00:19:00,100 --> 00:19:03,310
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>I'm going to play a little here,</i>
<i>then head over.</i></b></font>

211
00:19:03,430 --> 00:19:07,020
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>I just want to gauge</i>
<i>the present Kage's strength.</i></b></font>

212
00:19:08,390 --> 00:19:09,890
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>I got it.</i></b></font>

213
00:19:29,020 --> 00:19:34,390
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>He's a useless traitor
who went against Madara's plan.</b></font>

214
00:19:35,680 --> 00:19:41,390
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Until Obito dies,
I'll use his body to fight you.</b></font>

215
00:19:42,230 --> 00:19:44,350
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I've got to get some use
out of him,</b></font>

216
00:19:44,430 --> 00:19:46,350
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>at least at the end.</b></font>

217
00:19:47,520 --> 00:19:51,350
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>But killing you would be such
a waste with an eye like that.</b></font>

218
00:19:52,520 --> 00:19:53,770
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>How about it?</b></font>

219
00:19:54,520 --> 00:19:56,730
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>You're a survivor of
the Uchiha like me.</b></font>

220
00:19:57,430 --> 00:19:59,430
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Want to join forces?</b></font>

221
00:20:00,140 --> 00:20:04,520
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Make no mistake.
You're a dead man.</b></font>

222
00:20:06,230 --> 00:20:07,730
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Fine then...</b></font>

223
00:20:08,270 --> 00:20:12,180
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>In any case,
you don't have much time left.</b></font>

224
00:20:13,140 --> 00:20:14,350
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Fire Style...</b></font>

225
00:20:14,430 --> 00:20:16,430
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Hiding in Ash Jutsu!</b></font>

226
00:20:24,680 --> 00:20:27,480
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>Madara is regaining his past strength.</i></b></font>

227
00:20:28,680 --> 00:20:32,480
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b><i>Not good. His next target is...</i></b></font>

228
00:20:49,560 --> 00:20:54,520
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I'll be taking you all next...</b></font>

229
00:20:55,560 --> 00:20:57,520
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>you filthy beasts!</b></font>

230
00:22:36,610 --> 00:22:40,030
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>The taste of this blood,
this pain...

</b></font>

231
00:22:40,110 --> 00:22:41,490
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>This is my body!

</b></font>

232
00:22:41,950 --> 00:22:44,650
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>I can finally experience
and feel this fight.

</b></font>

233
00:22:45,200 --> 00:22:48,570
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>He's bleeding and wounded.

</b></font>

234
00:22:49,030 --> 00:22:52,070
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>In other words, he's not
a reanimation anymore.

</b></font>

235
00:22:52,280 --> 00:22:54,280
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>How did he come back to life?

</b></font>

236
00:22:54,490 --> 00:22:55,490
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>No way...

</b></font>

237
00:22:56,320 --> 00:22:59,530
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Next time on Naruto Shippuden:
"The Hidden Heart"

</b></font>

238
00:23:00,530 --> 00:23:02,570
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>No way...with Obito?

</b></font>

239
00:23:02,650 --> 00:23:04,890
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>THE HIDDEN HEART

</b></font>

240
00:23:04,940 --> 00:23:08,820
<font face="Open Sans Semibold" size="36"><b>Tune in again!

</b></font>

